OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAny
OL,6,Flingering rain will soon clear in the
OL,7,Feast this evening, leaving a mostly
OL,8,Fdry night with clear periods for a
OL,9,Fwhile. However, some showers arriving
OL,10,Ffrom the west later. Winds easing
OL,11,Fslightly overnight before
OL,12,Fstrengthening again close to dawn.
OL,13,
OL,14,CSunday:FGenerally Sunday promises to
OL,15,Fbe a brighter day than Saturday,
OL,16,Falthough a scattering of occasionally
OL,17,Fheavy showers are likely to feed
OL,18,Facross the country in the gusty
OL,19,Fsouthwesterly breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
