OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMonday
OL,6,Fand Tuesday look mild, cloudy and
OL,7,Fwindy with outbreaks of rain, which
OL,8,Fcould turn heavy. The rain should
OL,9,Fclear to leave a sunnier day on
OL,10,FWednesday, with scattered showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
